ia/randolph-county"],["ARC or PLC in Randolph County","/arc-plc/west-virginia/randolph-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 32 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids. In 2025, August to September came in at 55% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, January to February sat at 68% of normal on the middle of the grids. On grid 22399 the driest year was 1988, at 74% of normal.</p>"}
